 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Make Kakutei no Raibaru Reijou ni Tensei Shita no de Ouji-sama wa Akiramemasu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "負け確定のライバル令嬢に転生したので王子様は諦めます｡"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Claudia, a selfish and spoiled noblewoman, finds herself reincarnated in the world of an otome game. As she recalls her memories from her previous life, she realizes the dire consequences awaiting her: if she gets engaged to the prince, she'll be sent to a convent—a certain bad end!\n\nDetermined to avoid this fate, Claudia resolves to steer clear of the prince and do everything in her power to prevent the tragic scenario. She decides to follow the script, trying to get along with the main heroine and distance herself from the romantic interests. But no matter what she does, it seems like the distance between her and the characters only gets smaller...! Will she be able to escape her destined end, or is she falling deeper into the trap?",
   "ja": "ワガママ放題な悪役令嬢として、自分が乙女ゲームの世界に転生していることに気づいたクラウディア。前世を思い出したことによって「王子と婚約してしまうと修道院行き」になることも知り、バッドエンドを回避しようと決意する！なんとかフラグを回避するため、シナリオ通りメインヒロインと仲良く、攻略キャラクターからは逃げようと頑張ってみるが、距離は縮まるばかり……！？"
  },
